7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HmBE1FQzbh0Q7kNvwGDgiDx&_nc_oc=AdoXQIrlgf7V0GFXDR4uZUl1ByDwkYJJ0P41QHNUICBeGWbz_T5Pys5L1Awovvsw5D4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4EN0Geu_HK7lv_LsyiVP2LrF9aO-8Rc_XqBAZedD0AJA&oe=69FB3ED8"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2025-02-19 at 14.56.05.png", "id": "25652228037715697", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819464_25652228044382363_5730527552521063876_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7raWcwmuIZIQ7kNvwHmlc1H&_nc_oc=Adouhw6XU_dGeK5LFvQ0XDjNnXQfVivwaSkB4Fk2POeqOmnl8lKsfbGJ8RZ3_TmqRWM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5aED7t2QCR2dBpMxPTJ6wbdF5Rora1bYutsAdD-lYSIw&oe=69FB5844"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "2105423356657529", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_2105423363324195_5090811876925984097_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SUSFUUFQiEgQ7kNvwFgf_Z1&_nc_oc=AdrAbVrzFHJRU56idM24c0VVjPKE8JXFQqZlZKPswmAOleWx88yZR-4Wr84wNEluJH8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6H8AU-F5ozl-l98FlNN7uQE8u9vAe3ranuYU4-ltMaFw&oe=69FB4C1F"}, "display_name": "Among Giants", "keywords": ["climbing", "swinging", "bows", "giants", "adventure"], "long_description": "Among Giants is an open-world game where the player gets to explore the planet at their own pace, deciphering the alien language to get a better understanding of what has happened to humanity by hunting down colossal giants that roam the world and extracting their final memories.\n\n# The Giants and Others\nSome of the giants you will hunt and take them down\n{824636457215828}\nThe game has over 10 different types of enemies you will encounter from smaller Droids to a huge Spider Queen\n{830767046537926}\n\n# Meet R-011\nBefriend a feisty tiny Roller Droid, your gateway to understanding this world who will eventually be your closest ally. R-011 will be your Hacker, your Protector and your Friend\n{1332849368154885}\n\n# Your Horse\nExplore the huge alien world by riding your trusty steed. You can call for your horse anywhere with your Horn\n{1412359163842124}\n\n# Your Bow & Arrow\nFind special Quivers for your bow to help tackle those tricky targets\n{1617153256329705}\n\n# Grappling Hooks\nTraverse across the land using your grappling hooks and also use them to break open crates\n{875307924930249}\n\n# Gliding\nOutstretch your arms to glide your way to safety or distant platforms\n{1292691869326168}\n\n# Other Weapons\nThere are many other types of weaponry found in the world but use them wisely as they cannot be reloaded\n{827696256535054}\n\n# Hack Terminals & Locks\nDecipher the alien language a character at a time by hacking terminals and also break into buildings and gates by pick locking\n{1394160675459015}\n\n# Realtime Day & Night with Weather Systems\nThe battleground changes constantly when the day turns to night. Fight through heavy rain, a freezing blizzard and even in a scorching desert\n{1885682562347865}", "short_description": "You are Erya, the lone wanderer on a desolate world. You awaken among colossal giants, with their slow, deliberate movements resembling ancient deities. The world is scattered with robot relics, frozen in anguish, remnants of a lost civilization destroyed by a divine event. Can you uncover a connection between the giants, the planet, and your own origins?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://kmonkeygames.com/games/among-giants/among-giants-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "K Monkey Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.kmonkeygames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "459781504968480